    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Lia Cook writes: \"Animated video showing woven faces from the \"Su Series\" with MRI brain imaging of \r\nthe tracks that connect parts of the brain. Images from childhood portrait of Su merged with moving \r\nimages of the brain fibers from her adult brain.\"\r\n\r\nThe accompanying music is by CCRMA composer Chris Chafe and developed from electrocorticography (ECoG) sonification work undertaken for the Brain Stethoscope project with Josef Parvizi at Stanford.",
